== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Troll Warrior, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: ''Go find Ranjor. . .give note Ranjor. . .become great warrior.''

Ranjor's location is 308.29, -169.40, 27.00.

Upon handing him the tattered note:

: Ranjor says, 'Arhh.. Ranjor mighty warrior.. Ranjor teach you warrior.. you fight for Ranjor now.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standings with [[Da Bashers]] got better.
* Your faction standings with [[Broken Skull Clan]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the {{:Mud Covered Tunic}}.

